	(text_box "Rp 56k to VBUS on CC1 and CC2: 'default USB power', as on the DATA ×4; not 22k (1.5 A): the node's\n  TPS2553D switch (DUT_5V) limits at 1.34–1.52 A.  The node turns the board under test on and off.\nThe lead's pinout is the node's J7 mirrored: a 'Same direction' PH 8 cable (pin n to pin 9−n) joins them;\n  pins 1–3 (the node's INT and I²C) stay open here."
